      "findings": [
        "Grid cells do not repaint after a tap: a tap started the timer (meaning a reveal happened) but every cell still looks covered.",
        "The seven-segment panels are clipped: the 3-digit mine counter shows only 2 digit boxes and the MM:SS timer drops digits, because the Row had a fixed width narrower than its content."
      ],
